Subject: Peak season 2026 - capacity plan Venlo

Mark, the peak forecast for Nov-Dec is in. We expect +35% outbound volume com=
pared to the monthly average of the last 12 months. In Venlo that means rough=
ly 1,900 more order lines per day in the worst weeks, and our current two-shi=
ft setup will not cope.

My proposal:
- 25 temporary workers in Venlo, starting Monday 9 November
- Saturday shifts during the peak weeks
- extra trailer capacity from Veltrans, 12 trucks per day

I will send a cost split next week. Can you give me a first reaction on the a=
pproach? We need to sign the agency contract by the end of October, otherwise=
 the agency cannot guarantee the 25 people for 9 Nov.

